        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/94ad74/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-28T00:38:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>First of all, my apollogies for my bad English, I'll try to be as clear as possible :P</p><p>I read somewhere (I can't remember where) that Villain Cards were going to be Oversized with Vengeance, so it's going to be impossible to find regular-sized cards for those. Looking for consistency, I ordered the Oversized Villain Pack, and the promos were included in the order. Today, my order, has arrived, and I'm surprised to see the new promo Villains are regular-sized, so my question is: Will these villains have their own Oversized version? And, if that's the case, will it be possible to find them outside the GtG store? Because the shipping costs to Europe are 45$, and I would love to have all Villain Cards the same size.</p><p><span>Thanks in advance!</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:54.329Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
