        "created_at": "2013-12-28T02:40:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>They will - they're planning to print a second over-sized set of villain cards that will include all of the newer versions. I'm assuming they'll be available at local stores, but that's just an assumption; if the current set is available, it will be also.</p>",
