        "id": 85453,
        "name": "Koga",
        "username": "Koga",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-28T03:02:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So far we need corrections for The Dreamer, La Capitan and&nbsp;The Matriarch, plus adding in the new ones. Normal Spite could also use a corection for where on the card the start and end of turn stuff is, as it doesn't match the small card, even though there's only 1 card in the game that it matters for, Sub-Zero Atmoshpere.</p><p>I also just went through the cards and The Operative's advanced text on the small card says \"hero\", while the oversized card says \"hero target\". I'm assuming hero target is the correct one and that the small one just got overlooked.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
